## PROJECT OVERVIEW

This is a data analytics research project analyzing how LLM (large language model) 
mobile apps affect the broader mobile app ecosystem. The dataset was collected in 2023 
and the goal is to understand how adoption of AI apps like ChatGPT changes usage 
patterns of other mobile apps. This project will be submitted as a knowledge transfer 
document and clean replicable code package, and may be published academically.

