## AI APP CLASSIFICATION

A lookup table of 148 LLM/AI apps has been identified from the unique app names.
This is stored as AI_App_Names_df loaded from a CSV.
A new column IS_AI has been created in Usage_df:
Usage_df <- Usage_df %>%
  mutate(IS_AI = APPDESCRIPTION %in% AI_App_Names_df$APPDESCRIPTION)

Classification criteria:
- INCLUDED: Apps whose PRIMARY purpose is LLM/AI interaction (ChatGPT, Claude, 
  Gemini, Perplexity, Character AI, Copilot, Grok, Midjourney, DALL-E, etc.)
- INCLUDED: Generic AI chat apps, GPT-branded apps, AI image generators
- EXCLUDED: Apps with AI as a secondary feature (Duolingo, Bing Search, Grammarly)
- EXCLUDED: System apps, games, utilities that happen to use AI keyword

