## TREATMENT GROUP DEFINITION

TREATED = 1 means the panelist used at least one AI/LLM mobile app during the 
study period. This was defined by the client (Professor Kim) based on mobile app 
usage only — browser-based ChatGPT use on desktop/laptop does NOT count as treated.
~1,800 treated users (originally ~1,600 but ~200 Claude users added later).
~9,900 control users who used mobile apps but no AI/LLM apps.

